2795
02:47:12.134 --> 02:47:15.434
For these reasons, I strongly oppose the Summary Offences Amendment Bill.

2796
02:47:16.134 --> 02:47:19.734
To me, this bill reflects a fundamental misunderstanding of where responsibility

2797
02:47:19.774 --> 02:47:23.634
