2798
02:47:23.674 --> 02:47:25.634
have usually been failed by multiple systems.

2799
02:47:26.004 --> 02:47:28.504
They have fallen through gaps in housing, mental health services, addiction

2800
02:47:28.574 --> 02:47:31.714
treatment, child protection, healthcare, and income support.

2801
02:47:31.734 --> 02:47:34.404
Homelessness is not the failure, it is the outcome of those failures.

2802
02:47:35.354 --> 02:47:39.124
Yet instead of fixing those systems, this bill shifts the burden onto the people

2803
02:47:39.154 --> 02:47:42.844
