2808
02:47:54.734 --> 02:47:55.754
It does not mean that they are safer.

2809
02:47:56.114 --> 02:47:58.814
It simply means that they become someone else's problem somewhere else.

2810
02:47:59.194 --> 02:48:01.094
That is not a policy solution, it is displacement.

2811
02:48:01.794 --> 02:48:04.674
What concerns me the most is that this bill mistakes visibility for harm.

2812
02:48:05.234 --> 02:48:08.424
If fewer homeless people are visible in our town centers, homelessness is not being

2813
