reduced, it's simply being hidden.

2814
02:48:10.614 --> 02:48:13.134
We should not mistake making poverty less visible for making New Zealand better.

2815
02:48:13.954 --> 02:48:15.814
The government's own advice reflects these concerns.

2816
02:48:16.214 --> 02:48:19.554
