2820
02:48:27.434 --> 02:48:30.374
If Parliament genuinely wants to make safer communities, then we need stronger

2821
02:48:30.394 --> 02:48:34.114
systems, not stronger powers. We need more affordable housing, better mental health

2822
02:48:34.154 --> 02:48:37.854
support and addiction services, earlier intervention, and greater investment in the

2823
02:48:37.894 --> 02:48:40.763
