2824
02:48:41.453 --> 02:48:44.114
Ultimately, the measure of good government is not how effectively it moves

2825
02:48:44.154 --> 02:48:45.794
vulnerable people out of public spaces.

2826
02:48:46.174 --> 02:48:48.184
It is how effectively it prevents them from ending up there at all.

2827
02:48:48.814 --> 02:48:51.714
For those reasons, I respectfully ask the committee to recommend that the bill be

2828
