4894
05:20:15.162 --> 05:20:18.552
This includes people with neurological conditions, chronic illness,

4895
05:20:19.012 --> 05:20:22.212
mobility impairments, sensory disabilities, and mental health

4896
05:20:22.272 --> 05:20:26.172
conditions. People with epilepsy may fit into multiple of these

4897
05:20:26.232 --> 05:20:26.932
subcategories.

4898
05:20:28.612 --> 05:20:32.352
New Zealand media has repeatedly reported disabled people sleeping in cars,

4899
05:20:32.752 --> 05:20:36.392
garages, riverbanks, and public spaces, including in the

4900
05:20:36.412 --> 05:20:36.852
