4933
05:22:28.892 --> 05:22:32.692
A major 2023 study in the Journal of Neural Transmission found

4934
05:22:33.072 --> 05:22:35.972
homeless people have higher prevalence of seizures and epilepsy.

4935
05:22:36.812 --> 05:22:40.172
Children in homeless families have higher risk of epilepsy, often

4936
05:22:40.232 --> 05:22:40.832
undetected.

4937
05:22:41.952 --> 05:22:45.852
80% of homeless people miss medical appointments due to lack of transport or a

4938
