4939
05:22:47.602 --> 05:22:51.261
Medication cannot be stored safely or taken consistently.

4940
05:22:51.272 --> 05:22:54.972
Hospitalization rates are five times higher, and epilepsy plus

4941
05:22:55.012 --> 05:22:58.572
homelessness creates a stigmatized, neglected, under-researched niche.

4942
