05:49:34.028 --> 05:49:37.717
who still find themselves homeless today have had much less privilege than I

5322
05:49:37.747 --> 05:49:41.588
had. They have never known stable housing and can never forget

5323
05:49:41.668 --> 05:49:43.268
days and weeks going without food.

5324
05:49:44.308 --> 05:49:47.688
My white skin did not get beaten half as much as my Brown friends.

5325
05:49:48.268 --> 05:49:50.388
I don't get profiled or harassed by police.

5326
05:49:50.928 --> 05:49:54.668
Hey, Pakeha, I've never had to face the institutionalized racism that is

5327
05:49:54.708 --> 05:49:58.288
woven into our schools, our welfare, and our healthcare systems.

5328
05:49:58.428 --> 05:50:02.388
I saw the kind faces of those systems, and still, they almost killed me.

5329
05:50:03.748 --> 05:50:07.328
ACC cut off support just weeks after I had been raped for the last time.

5330
05:50:08.068 --> 05:50:10.988
For months, while I was searching for a flat, I had no place to live.

5331
05:50:11.428 --> 05:50:13.948
I survived because friends let me sleep on their couches.

5332
05:50:15.168 --> 05:50:18.108
That's what homelessness looks like for women predominantly, because it is much

5333
05:50:18.128 --> 05:50:19.888
more dangerous for us out there on the streets.

5334
05:50:21.568 --> 05:50:24.928
I found a place. I was lucky. I found a place within four months, whereas I've

5335
05:50:24.968 --> 05:50:27.708
talked to one Black friend who was searching for four years.

5336
05:50:28.508 --> 05:50:32.097
I grew up middle class, so I have a law degree, and so I

5337
05:50:32.128 --> 05:50:36.108
knew when our landlord kept showing up without notice that I could tell him

5338
05:50:36.188 --> 05:50:40.028
our tenancy rights. I knew his attempts to threaten us with photos he'd

5339
05:50:40.068 --> 05:50:43.928
taken of my flatmate's bong were not going to land either of us white females in

5340
05:50:43.988 --> 05:50:44.408
prison.

5341
05:50:45.348 --> 05:50:48.817
We had to leave that house in a rush after being sick for months.

5342
05:50:49.037 --> 05:50:51.398
We discovered mushrooms and mold growing from the ceiling.

5343
05:50:52.048 --> 05:50:55.988
And I could speak the legal English we needed to get through tenancy tribunal,

5344
05:50:56.028 --> 05:50:59.368
but that privilege only helped us get back a fraction of the rent we'd lost.

5345
05:50:59.548 --> 05:51:02.628
It did not help us find safe, healthy, long-term housing.

5346
05:51:03.688 --> 05:51:07.628
Again, we were privileged to have middle-class friends who already had housing

5347
05:51:07.648 --> 05:51:11.148
that could accommodate us, but it strained those relationships.

5348
05:51:11.828 --> 05:51:15.128
You've got to understand that many people on the streets would rather sleep rough

5349
05:51:15.228 --> 05:51:17.528
than feel like a burden to their friends and family.

5350
05:51:18.188 --> 05:51:21.668
And you've got to understand that many people do not have

5351
05:51:21.728 --> 05:51:22.848
families like you.

5352
05:51:24.648 --> 05:51:28.348
The most dangerous place for me to live was with my family, and the same is true

5353
05:51:28.388 --> 05:51:31.847
for countless survivors of domestic violence and sexual abuse who would rather

5354
05:51:31.888 --> 05:51:33.368
rough it on the streets than go home.

5355
05:51:34.228 --> 05:51:38.118
New Zealand has one of the worst rates of child sexual abuse in the OECD countries,

5356
05:51:38.548 --> 05:51:42.108
and still, we know that 92% of sexual assaults aren't even

5357
05:51:42.128 --> 05:51:45.977
reported. We have absolutely no idea how many

5358
05:51:46.008 --> 05:51:49.347
children were abused in pedophile rings like the one my father took me to,

5359
05:51:50.287 --> 05:51:53.848
let alone how many adult survivors are sleeping rough still suffering with the

5360
05:51:53.928 --> 05:51:54.788
consequences.

5361
05:51:55.788 --> 05:51:59.328
During the 11 years that my father took me to that place, I saw thousands of kids

5362
05:51:59.368 --> 05:52:03.248
pass through it, yet I have met only two adult survivors who've trusted me enough

5363
05:52:03.288 --> 05:52:06.248
to talk about it, because we survive by keeping quiet.

5364
05:52:07.838 --> 05:52:11.378
So I can't tell you exactly how many rough sleepers have escaped from abuse, but I

5365
05:52:11.408 --> 05:52:14.818
can tell you that every single one of them will be harmed profoundly by this

5366
05:52:14.868 --> 05:52:18.848
bill. Most of them can't talk about it, especially not the

5367
05:52:18.888 --> 05:52:22.728
ones who are just escaping, kids who are aging out of the pedophile rings

5368
05:52:22.828 --> 05:52:25.588
right now. These move-on orders would apply to them.

5369
05:52:26.168 --> 05:52:29.868
14-year-olds who have just grown strong enough to fight back against their abusive

5370
05:52:29.908 --> 05:52:33.718
father or 16-year-olds who are just having sex for the first time and

5371
05:52:33.728 --> 05:52:37.268
realizing that what their mother called their special time was actually rape.

5372
05:52:38.388 --> 05:52:39.948
Where do you think they should move on to?

5373
05:52:40.728 --> 05:52:44.548
If you were them, would you rather go back home and get raped again or sleep

5374
05:52:44.588 --> 05:52:45.528
rough on the streets?

5375
05:52:46.868 --> 05:52:50.768
Next time you hear somebody say homelessness is a choice, I want you to tell them

5376
05:52:50.828 --> 05:52:54.708
about these kids and the choices that they are facing, abuse

5377
05:52:54.748 --> 05:52:57.468
or homelessness, because that's the lived reality,

5378
05:52:58.728 --> 05:53:02.188
not just for survivors of pedophile rings, not just for survivors of

5379
05:53:02.228 --> 05:53:05.968
sexual abuse, but anybody who's impacted by domestic

5380
05:53:06.008 --> 05:53:08.418
violence, which we know is rampant in this country.

5381
05:53:09.148 --> 05:53:12.208
Should they stay with the violence they know at home or risk being moved into the

5382
05:53:12.228 --> 05:53:16.108
violence of prisons? If you can have compassion for these kids,

5383
05:53:16.368 --> 05:53:20.108
please do not hear this and simply raise the age from 14, because

5384
05:53:20.148 --> 05:53:22.588
life does not get suddenly easier at 18.

5385
05:53:23.088 --> 05:53:26.988
There is no age at which we are free from the effects of this trauma, especially

5386
05:53:27.028 --> 05:53:30.898
not in a society that continually compounds them and ignores them and

5387
05:53:30.908 --> 05:53:34.068
blames us for them. Not when ACC

5388
05:53:34.108 --> 05:53:36.668
re-traumatizes us and leaves us out in the cold.

5389
05:53:37.188 --> 05:53:41.128
Not when our justice system leaves 90% of rapists free to assault us

5390
05:53:41.188 --> 05:53:44.268
again and then locks up our tane who are willing to defend us.

5391
05:53:45.272 --> 05:53:49.152
I'm not asking you to fix these systematic justices today that create

5392
05:53:49.172 --> 05:53:53.112
homelessness. I'm not even asking you to do anything to help us.

5393
05:53:53.492 --> 05:53:57.152
I'm asking you not to make it 100 times harder for us to survive.

5394
05:53:57.892 --> 05:54:01.572
I'm asking you not to make it worse, and this bill will only make it

5395
05:54:01.672 --> 05:54:05.572
worse. I have seen friends after they've just come out from prison, just for

5396
05:54:05.592 --> 05:54:08.232
a night, and they're never better off for it.

5397
05:54:08.242 --> 05:54:12.002
They are more traumatized, and they are more tightly wound, and they are more

5398
05:54:12.032 --> 05:54:14.312
likely to react aggressively.

5399
05:54:19.872 --> 05:54:23.392
If you give more people who already feel worthless

5400
05:54:25.412 --> 05:54:28.612
more proof that the world does not care about them, you're going to get more

5401
05:54:28.652 --> 05:54:32.032
violence, not less. If there's any time, I will take questions.

5402
05:54:34.372 --> 05:54:38.232
Thank you, Vee. I just want to thank you for your bravery and for coming and

5403
05:54:38.332 --> 05:54:42.152
speaking with us this afternoon, and for sharing your story as well,

5404
05:54:42.232 --> 05:54:44.872
alongside the submission that you've presented to us. So thank you.

5405
05:54:45.952 --> 05:54:49.152
It doesn't look like we do have any questions from any of the members, but we're

5406
05:54:49.232 --> 05:54:52.212
just really grateful for your presentation and the written submission you've made

5407
05:54:52.252 --> 05:54:53.512
as well. So thank you very much.

5408
05:54:53.832 --> 05:54:55.672
Have I got a moment to add one extra point then?

5409
05:54:55.892 --> 05:54:56.632
Yes, absolutely.

5410
05:54:57.292 --> 05:54:58.572
I just want to speak to

5411
05:55:00.912 --> 05:55:04.812
question how many actual people who've experienced

5412
05:55:04.872 --> 05:55:08.162
homelessness you're hearing from in all of these submissions, because it's been

5413
05:55:08.232 --> 05:55:12.042
really hard to get anybody else to feel like there's any

5414
05:55:12.172 --> 05:55:13.312
point in talking to you,

5415
05:55:14.192 --> 05:55:15.942
because they already feel hopeless.

5416
05:55:16.292 --> 05:55:19.552
And I think if you're going to be making laws about people's lives, you need to

5417
05:55:19.612 --> 05:55:23.562
understand what their lives are. And you can't do that if you're not

5418
05:55:23.612 --> 05:55:27.542
talking to them, because you don't know the specific challenges that

5419
05:55:27.572 --> 05:55:31.172
we face. Even if housing had got the perfect place for

5420
05:55:31.212 --> 05:55:34.572
me, if my next door neighbor had even looked like my dad,

5421
05:55:35.952 --> 05:55:37.212
I wouldn't have been able to sleep there.

5422
05:55:37.472 --> 05:55:40.912
If they'd said, "Oh, I knew your dad at school," I would've run.

5423
05:55:41.172 --> 05:55:45.012
I would've been out of that whole area and

5424
05:55:45.272 --> 05:55:46.312
never told anyone.

5425
05:55:46.932 --> 05:55:50.852
You have to talk to the people

5426
05:55:50.912 --> 05:55:53.752
who the laws that you're making are affecting,

5427
05:55:54.812 --> 05:55:58.352
and I don't see that their voices are being heard in this process.

5428
