This is only day two of us hearing submissions.

5431
05:56:06.012 --> 05:56:09.732
We're still hearing submissions on Tuesday and Wednesday of next week as well on

5432
05:56:09.772 --> 05:56:13.252
the bill. But we have heard from a vast range of different

5433
05:56:13.292 --> 05:56:14.572
people on the bill.

5434
