We obviously just take the submitters that submit on the legislation when we

5435
05:56:19.312 --> 05:56:20.292
listen to submissions,

5436
05:56:21.232 --> 05:56:23.762
which is open to everybody to do. But appreciate that-

5437
05:56:23.782 --> 05:56:27.232
Yeah, that's what I mean, though. The submissions process isn't open to everybody.

5438
05:56:27.292 --> 05:56:31.172
It's been shortened, and it's already in a

5439
05:56:31.242 --> 05:56:34.932
process that is not accessible to huge portions of the

5440
05:56:34.972 --> 05:56:38.472
population if they don't have access to phones or computers or an

5441
05:56:38.512 --> 05:56:40.632
understanding of the legal system.

5442
05:56:41.372 --> 05:56:42.452
Vee, many of us agree with you.

5443
05:56:44.072 --> 05:56:44.552
Understand.

5444
05:56:45.472 --> 05:56:47.692
Thank you, Vee. Thank you for joining us this afternoon.

5445
05:56:47.892 --> 05:56:51.392
We're going to come to our next submitter, which is from the Coalition to End

5446
05:56:51.452 --> 05:56:55.252
Women's Homelessness, which is Victoria

5447
05:56:55.312 --> 05:56:56.012
and Amanda.

5448
05:56:57.412 --> 05:56:58.752
And Wendy, I believe.

5449
05:56:59.532 --> 05:57:02.352
Wendy won't be joining us, just Victoria and Amanda today.

5450
05:57:02.412 --> 05:57:05.882
So thank you to the chair and to the members of the committee.

5451
05:57:06.212 --> 05:57:09.952
We appreciate you and your time. And I just want to acknowledge Vee

5452
05:57:09.972 --> 05:57:13.832
before us and her bravery, too, because much of what Vee spoke about, we

5453
05:57:13.852 --> 05:57:17.032
